<title>DENMARK: FORECAST-ISS 1996 profits seen tumbling.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-ISS 1996 profits seen tumbling.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight analysts polled by Reuters in a survey published on Friday predicted almost 12 percent lower 1996 profits before tax and extraordinary items for Danish cleaning and services group International Service System (ISS).</p>
<p>The panel said the result would have been satisfactory had it not been marred by vast losses incurred early last year in a falsified accounts scandal in its U.S. ISS Inc unit which led to a first-half 1996 group loss of two billion crowns.</p>
